    "Choose the folder where your coding agent reads skills. Health.md will install or update its user-facing CLI skill there." : {
      "comment" : "macOS production UI",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wählen Sie den Ordner aus, aus dem Ihr Coding-Agent Skills liest. Health.md installiert oder aktualisiert dort sein benutzerorientiertes CLI-Skill."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Choose the folder where your coding agent reads skills. Health.md will install or update its user-facing CLI skill there."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Elija la carpeta donde su agente de codificación lee las habilidades. Health.md instalará o actualizará allí su habilidad CLI orientada al usuario."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Choisissez le dossier dans lequel votre agent de codage lit les compétences. Health.md y installera ou mettra à jour sa compétence CLI destinée aux utilisateurs."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scegli la cartella in cui il tuo agente di codifica legge le competenze. Health.md installerà o aggiornerà lì la sua competenza CLI rivolta all'utente."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "コーディング エージェントがスキルを読み取るフォルダーを選択します。 Health.md は、ユーザー向けの CLI スキルをそこにインストールまたは更新します。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "코딩 에이전트가 기술을 읽는 폴더를 선택합니다. Health.md는 해당 위치에 사용자 대상 CLI 기술을 설치하거나 업데이트합니다."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kies de map waarin uw codeeragent vaardigheden leest. Health.md zal daar de gebruikersgerichte CLI-vaardigheid installeren of bijwerken."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Escolha a pasta onde seu agente de codificação lê as habilidades. Health.md instalará ou atualizará sua habilidade CLI voltada para o usuário lá."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
