    "Connect Codex or Claude to analyze health context, render native charts, and run approved iPhone exports while Health.md owns the connection, sandbox access, and localhost server." : {
      "comment" : "macOS production UI",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Verbinden Sie Codex oder Claude, um Gesundheitskontexte zu analysieren, native Diagramme darzustellen und genehmigte iPhone-Exporte durchzuführen, während Health.md die Verbindung, den Sandbox-Zugriff und den lokalen Server verwaltet."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Connect Codex or Claude to analyze health context, render native charts, and run approved iPhone exports while Health.md owns the connection, sandbox access, and localhost server."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Conecte Codex o Claude para analizar el contexto de salud, representar gráficos nativos y ejecutar exportaciones iPhone aprobadas, mientras que Health.md posee la conexión, el acceso a la zona de pruebas y el servidor localhost."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Connectez Codex ou Claude pour analyser le contexte d'intégrité, afficher des graphiques natifs et exécuter des exportations iPhone approuvées tandis que Health.md possède la connexion, l'accès au sandbox et le serveur localhost."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Connetti Codex o Claude per analizzare il contesto sanitario, eseguire il rendering di grafici nativi ed eseguire esportazioni iPhone approvate mentre Health.md possiede la connessione, l'accesso sandbox e il server host locale."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Codex または Claude に接続して、健康コンテキストを分析し、ネイティブ グラフをレンダリングし、承認された iPhone エクスポートを実行します。一方、Health.md は接続、サンドボックス アクセス、ローカルホスト サーバーを所有します。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Codex 또는 Claude를 연결하여 상태 컨텍스트를 분석하고, 기본 차트를 렌더링하고, 승인된 iPhone 내보내기를 실행하고, Health.md는 연결, 샌드박스 액세스 및 로컬 호스트 서버를 소유합니다."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Verbind Codex of Claude om de gezondheidscontext te analyseren, native grafieken weer te geven en goedgekeurde iPhone-exports uit te voeren, terwijl Health.md eigenaar is van de verbinding, sandbox-toegang en localhost-server."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Conecte Codex ou Claude para analisar o contexto de integridade, renderizar gráficos nativos e executar exportações iPhone aprovadas enquanto Health.md possui a conexão, o acesso à sandbox e o servidor localhost."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "连接 Codex 或 Claude 以分析健康状况、渲染本机图表并运行批准的 iPhone 导出，同时 Health.md 拥有连接、沙箱访问和本地主机服务器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
