          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connected iPhone-to-Mac exports recover more reliably and use less memory while preparing large summaries." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Exporte über eine iPhone-Mac-Verbindung werden zuverlässiger fortgesetzt und benötigen beim Vorbereiten großer Zusammenfassungen weniger Arbeitsspeicher."}},
        "es": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Las exportaciones mediante conexión de iPhone a Mac se recuperan con mayor fiabilidad y usan menos memoria al preparar resúmenes grandes."}},
        "fr": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Les exportations connectées de l’iPhone vers le Mac reprennent plus sûrement et utilisent moins de mémoire lors de la préparation de synthèses volumineuses."}},
        "it": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Le esportazioni tramite connessione da iPhone a Mac riprendono in modo più affidabile e usano meno memoria durante la preparazione di riepiloghi di grandi dimensioni."}},
        "ja": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"iPhoneとMacを接続して行うエクスポートの復旧がより確実になり、大規模なサマリーの準備中に使用するメモリも削減されました。"}},
        "ko": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"iPhone과 Mac 간 연결을 통한 내보내기가 더 안정적으로 복구되며, 대규모 요약을 준비할 때 메모리를 더 적게 사용합니다."}},
        "nl": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Exports via een verbinding van iPhone naar Mac worden betrouwbaarder hervat en gebruiken minder geheugen bij het voorbereiden van grote samenvattingen."}},
        "pt-BR": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"As exportações do iPhone para o Mac com conexão se recuperam de forma mais confiável e usam menos memória ao preparar resumos grandes."}},
        "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"iPhone 与 Mac 连接导出的恢复更可靠，生成大型汇总时占用的内存也更少。"}}
      }
    },
    "Connected locally; check destination readiness below" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lokal verbunden; prüfen Sie unten, ob das Ziel bereit ist"
