    "Custom frontmatter keys, snake_case or camelCase styles, and disabled metric fields now behave consistently in Markdown output." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Eigene Frontmatter-Schlüssel, snake_case- oder camelCase-Schreibweisen und deaktivierte Metrikfelder werden jetzt in der Markdown-Ausgabe einheitlich berücksichtigt."}},
        "es": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Las claves de frontmatter personalizadas, los estilos snake_case o camelCase y los campos de métricas deshabilitados ahora se comportan de forma coherente en la salida Markdown."}},
        "fr": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Les clés de frontmatter personnalisées, les styles snake_case ou camelCase et les champs d’indicateurs désactivés se comportent désormais de manière cohérente dans la sortie Markdown."}},
        "it": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Le chiavi frontmatter personalizzate, gli stili snake_case o camelCase e i campi delle metriche disabilitati ora si comportano in modo coerente nell'output Markdown."}},
        "ja": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Markdown出力で、カスタムfrontmatterキー、snake_caseまたはcamelCase形式、無効な指標フィールドが一貫して動作するようになりました。"}},
        "ko": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"이제 사용자 지정 frontmatter 키, snake_case 또는 camelCase 스타일, 비활성화된 항목 필드가 Markdown 출력에서 일관되게 적용됩니다."}},
        "nl": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aangepaste frontmatter-sleutels, snake_case- of camelCase-stijlen en uitgeschakelde meetwaardevelden werken nu consistent in Markdown-uitvoer."}},
        "pt-BR": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Chaves personalizadas de frontmatter, estilos snake_case ou camelCase e campos de métricas desativados agora se comportam de forma consistente na saída Markdown."}},
        "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"自定义 frontmatter 键、snake_case 或 camelCase 样式以及已禁用的指标字段现在在 Markdown 输出中表现一致。"}}
      }
    },
    "Custom keys, disabled fields, and camelCase distance settings automatically migrate to the new mile fields." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Eigene Schlüssel, deaktivierte Felder und camelCase-Distanzeinstellungen werden automatisch auf die neuen Meilenfelder übertragen."}},
        "es": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Las claves personalizadas, los campos deshabilitados y los ajustes de distancia en camelCase se migran automáticamente a los nuevos campos de millas."}},
        "fr": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Les clés personnalisées, les champs désactivés et les paramètres de distance en camelCase sont automatiquement transférés vers les nouveaux champs en miles."}},
        "it": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Le chiavi personalizzate, i campi disabilitati e le impostazioni delle distanze in camelCase vengono migrati automaticamente ai nuovi campi in miglia."}},
        "ja": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"カスタムキー、無効なフィールド、camelCaseの距離設定は、新しいマイルのフィールドに自動的に移行されます。"}},
        "ko": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"사용자 지정 키, 비활성화된 필드, camelCase 거리 설정이 새 마일 필드로 자동 이전됩니다."}},
        "nl": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aangepaste sleutels, uitgeschakelde velden en camelCase-afstandsinstellingen worden automatisch overgezet naar de nieuwe velden voor mijlen."}},
        "pt-BR": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Chaves personalizadas, campos desativados e configurações de distância em camelCase são migrados automaticamente para os novos campos de milhas."}},
        "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"自定义键、已禁用的字段和 camelCase 距离设置会自动迁移到新的英里字段。"}}
      }
    },
