    "Disconnect revokes Health.md in WHOOP before removing the on-device Keychain credentials." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Beim Trennen wird zuerst der Zugriff von Health.md in WHOOP widerrufen. Danach werden die Zugangsdaten aus der Keychain auf dem Gerät entfernt."}},
        "es": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Al desconectar, se revoca el acceso de Health.md en WHOOP antes de eliminar las credenciales de Keychain del dispositivo."}},
        "fr": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"La déconnexion révoque Health.md dans WHOOP avant de supprimer les identifiants du Keychain sur l’appareil."}},
        "it": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"La disconnessione revoca l'accesso di Health.md in WHOOP prima di rimuovere le credenziali Keychain sul dispositivo."}},
        "ja": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"切断時は、WHOOPでHealth.mdの認可を取り消してから、デバイス上のKeychain認証情報を削除します。"}},
        "ko": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"연결을 해제하면 기기의 Keychain 인증 정보를 삭제하기 전에 WHOOP에서 Health.md의 접근 권한을 철회합니다."}},
        "nl": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bij het verbreken wordt eerst de toegang van Health.md in WHOOP ingetrokken en worden daarna de Keychain-toegangsgegevens op het apparaat verwijderd."}},
        "pt-BR": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ao desconectar, o acesso do Health.md no WHOOP é revogado antes de remover as credenciais do Keychain no dispositivo."}},
        "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"断开连接时，会先在 WHOOP 中撤销 Health.md 的授权，再移除设备上的 Keychain 凭据。"}}
      }
    },
