    "Exports a single day's health data to your Health.md vault." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Exportiert die Gesundheitsdaten eines einzelnen Tages in deinen Health.md-Vault."}},
        "es": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Exporta los datos de salud de un solo día a tu bóveda de Health.md."}},
        "fr": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Exporte les données de santé d’une seule journée vers votre coffre Health.md."}},
        "it": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Esporta i dati sanitari di un singolo giorno nel tuo vault Health.md."}},
        "ja": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"1日分のヘルスデータをHealth.mdの保管庫にエクスポートします。"}},
        "ko": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"하루의 건강 데이터를 Health.md 보관함으로 내보냅니다."}},
        "nl": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Exporteert de gezondheidsgegevens van één dag naar je Health.md-kluis."}},
        "pt-BR": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Exporta os dados de saúde de um único dia para seu cofre do Health.md."}},
        "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"将单日健康数据导出到你的 Health.md 库。"}}
      }
    },
    "Exports are versioned and self-describing with schema %@ v%lld. Existing files continue to work; re-export old ranges only when you want fully consistent v%lld units and history." : {
      "comment" : "macOS production UI",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Exporte sind versioniert und selbstbeschreibend mit dem Schema %1$@ v%2$lld. Vorhandene Dateien funktionieren weiterhin; Exportieren Sie alte Bereiche nur dann erneut, wenn Sie vollständig konsistente v%3$lld-Einheiten und -Historie wünschen."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Exports are versioned and self-describing with schema %1$@ v%2$lld. Existing files continue to work; re-export old ranges only when you want fully consistent v%3$lld units and history."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Las exportaciones están versionadas y son autodescriptivas con el esquema %1$@ v%2$lld. Los archivos existentes siguen funcionando; Vuelva a exportar rangos antiguos solo cuando desee unidades e historial v%3$lld totalmente consistentes."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les exportations sont versionnées et auto-descriptives avec le schéma %1$@ v%2$lld. Les fichiers existants continuent de fonctionner ; réexportez les anciennes plages uniquement lorsque vous souhaitez des unités et un historique v%3$lld entièrement cohérents."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le esportazioni sono dotate di versione e autodescrittive con lo schema %1$@ v%2$lld. I file esistenti continuano a funzionare; riesporta i vecchi intervalli solo quando desideri unità e cronologia v%3$lld completamente coerenti."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "エクスポートはバージョン管理され、スキーマ %1$@ v%2$lld で自己記述されます。既存のファイルは引き続き機能します。完全に一貫性のある v%3$lld 単位と履歴が必要な場合にのみ、古い範囲を再エクスポートしてください。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "내보내기는 버전이 지정되고 스키마 %1$@ v%2$lld를 사용하여 자체 설명됩니다. 기존 파일은 계속 작동합니다. 완전히 일관된 v%3$lld 장치 및 기록이 필요한 경우에만 이전 범위를 다시 내보냅니다."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Exporten zijn voorzien van een versie en beschrijven zichzelf met schema %1$@ v%2$lld. Bestaande bestanden blijven werken; oude bereiken alleen opnieuw exporteren als u volledig consistente v%3$lld-eenheden en geschiedenis wilt."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "As exportações são versionadas e autodescritivas com o esquema %1$@ v%2$lld. Os arquivos existentes continuam funcionando; reexporte intervalos antigos somente quando desejar unidades e histórico v%3$lld totalmente consistentes."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "导出采用模式 %1$@ v%2$lld 进行版本控制和自描述。现有文件继续有效；仅当您需要完全一致的 v%3$lld 单位和历史记录时，才重新导出旧范围。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Exports every day from start to end (inclusive) to your Health.md vault." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Exportiert jeden Tag vom Start- bis zum Enddatum (einschließlich) in deinen Health.md-Vault."}},
        "es": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Exporta todos los días desde el inicio hasta el final (ambos incluidos) a tu bóveda de Health.md."}},
        "fr": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Exporte chaque journée de la date de début à la date de fin (incluses) vers votre coffre Health.md."}},
        "it": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Esporta ogni giorno dall'inizio alla fine (inclusi) nel tuo vault Health.md."}},
        "ja": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"開始日から終了日までの毎日のデータを、両日を含めてHealth.mdの保管庫にエクスポートします。"}},
        "ko": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"시작일부터 종료일까지 양 끝 날짜를 포함한 모든 날짜의 데이터를 Health.md 보관함으로 내보냅니다."}},
        "nl": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Exporteert elke dag van begin tot en met einde naar je Health.md-kluis."}},
        "pt-BR": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Exporta todos os dias do início ao fim (inclusive) para seu cofre do Health.md."}},
        "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"将开始日期到结束日期之间每一天（含首尾两天）的数据导出到你的 Health.md 库。"}}
      }
    },
