    },
    "Exports update only your daily notes. Other generated files stay configured but are skipped." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Exporte aktualisieren nur deine täglichen Notizen. Andere Ausgabedateien bleiben konfiguriert, werden aber übersprungen."}},
        "es" : {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Las exportaciones solo actualizan tus notas diarias. Los demás archivos de salida conservan su configuración, pero se omiten."}},
        "fr" : {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Les exports mettent à jour uniquement vos notes quotidiennes. Les autres fichiers de sortie restent configurés, mais sont ignorés."}},
        "it" : {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Le esportazioni aggiornano solo le note giornaliere. Gli altri file di output restano configurati ma vengono saltati."}},
        "ja" : {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"書き出しではデイリーノートのみを更新します。ほかの出力ファイルの設定は保持されますが、作成はスキップされます。"}},
        "ko" : {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"내보내기는 일일 노트만 업데이트합니다. 다른 출력 파일의 설정은 유지되지만 생성은 건너뜁니다."}},
        "nl" : {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Exports werken alleen je dagelijkse notities bij. Andere uitvoerbestanden blijven ingesteld, maar worden overgeslagen."}},
        "pt-BR" : {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"As exportações atualizam apenas suas notas diárias. Os outros arquivos de saída mantêm a configuração, mas são ignorados."}},
        "zh-Hans" : {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"导出仅更新每日笔记。其他输出文件保留配置，但会被跳过。"}}
      }
    },
    "Exports update YAML frontmatter in the daily notes you already keep, while normal export files still follow your selected formats." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Exporte aktualisieren das YAML-Frontmatter Ihrer bestehenden täglichen Notizen; reguläre Exportdateien werden weiterhin in den von Ihnen ausgewählten Formaten erstellt."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
