    "If `~/.local/bin` is not on your PATH, add `export PATH=\"$HOME/.local/bin:$PATH\"` to your shell config." : {
      "comment" : "macOS production UI",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wenn `~/.local/bin` nicht auf Ihrem PATH vorhanden ist, fügen Sie `export PATH=\"$HOME/.local/bin:$PATH\"` zu Ihrer Shell-Konfiguration hinzu."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If `~/.local/bin` is not on your PATH, add `export PATH=\"$HOME/.local/bin:$PATH\"` to your shell config."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si `~/.local/bin` no está en su PATH, agregue `export PATH=\"$HOME/.local/bin:$PATH\"` a su configuración de shell."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si `~/.local/bin` n'est pas sur votre PATH, ajoutez `export PATH=\"$HOME/.local/bin:$PATH\"` à votre configuration shell."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se `~/.local/bin` non è sul tuo PATH, aggiungi `export PATH=\"$HOME/.local/bin:$PATH\"` alla configurazione della shell."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "`~/.local/bin` が PATH にない場合は、`export PATH=\"$HOME/.local/bin:$PATH\"` をシェル構成に追加します。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "`~/.local/bin`가 PATH에 없으면 쉘 구성에 `export PATH=\"$HOME/.local/bin:$PATH\"`를 추가하세요."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Als `~/.local/bin` niet op uw PATH staat, voegt u `export PATH=\"$HOME/.local/bin:$PATH\"` toe aan uw shell-configuratie."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se `~/.local/bin` não estiver em seu PATH, adicione `export PATH=\"$HOME/.local/bin:$PATH\"` à configuração do seu shell."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果 `~/.local/bin` 不在您的 PATH 上，请将 `export PATH=\"$HOME/.local/bin:$PATH\"` 添加到您的 shell 配置中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If the suggested fix does not work, include this message in your bug report after removing any private folder or server information." : {
      "comment" : "macOS production UI",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Falls die vorgeschlagene Lösung nicht funktioniert, fügen Sie diese Nachricht Ihrem Fehlerbericht hinzu, nachdem Sie alle privaten Ordner- oder Serverinformationen entfernt haben."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If the suggested fix does not work, include this message in your bug report after removing any private folder or server information."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si la solución sugerida no funciona, incluya este mensaje en su informe de error después de eliminar cualquier carpeta privada o información del servidor."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si le correctif suggéré ne fonctionne pas, incluez ce message dans votre rapport de bogue après avoir supprimé tout dossier privé ou information sur le serveur."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se la soluzione suggerita non funziona, includi questo messaggio nella segnalazione del bug dopo aver rimosso eventuali cartelle private o informazioni sul server."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "提案された修正が機能しない場合は、プライベート フォルダーまたはサーバー情報を削除した後、このメッセージをバグ レポートに含めてください。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "제안된 수정 사항이 작동하지 않으면 개인 폴더나 서버 정보를 제거한 후 버그 보고서에 이 메시지를 포함하세요."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Als de voorgestelde oplossing niet werkt, neem dan dit bericht op in uw bugrapport nadat u eventuele privémap- of serverinformatie hebt verwijderd."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se a correção sugerida não funcionar, inclua esta mensagem em seu relatório de bug após remover qualquer pasta privada ou informação do servidor."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果建议的修复不起作用，请在删除任何私人文件夹或服务器信息后将此消息包含在错误报告中。"
          }
        }
      }
