    "Inject select metrics directly into your existing daily notes' YAML frontmatter without creating separate health files." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ausgewählte Metriken direkt in das YAML-Frontmatter Ihrer bestehenden täglichen Notizen einfügen, ohne separate Gesundheitsdateien zu erstellen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Inyecta métricas seleccionadas directamente en el frontmatter YAML de tus notas diarias existentes sin crear archivos de salud separados."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Injectez des métriques sélectionnées directement dans le frontmatter YAML de vos notes quotidiennes existantes sans créer de fichiers de santé séparés."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Inietta metriche selezionate direttamente nel frontmatter YAML delle tue note giornaliere esistenti senza creare file sanitari separati."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "個別のヘルスファイルを作成せずに、選択した指標を既存のデイリーノートのYAMLフロントマターに直接注入します。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "별도의 건강 파일을 만들지 않고 선택한 항목을 기존 일일 노트의 YAML 프론트매터에 직접 주입합니다."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Voeg geselecteerde meetwaarden rechtstreeks in de YAML-frontmatter van je bestaande dagelijkse notities in, zonder aparte gezondheidsbestanden aan te maken."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Injete métricas selecionadas diretamente no frontmatter YAML das suas notas diárias existentes sem criar arquivos de saúde separados."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "将选定的指标直接注入现有每日笔记的 YAML frontmatter 中，无需创建单独的健康文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Injects selected metrics into your existing daily notes' YAML frontmatter. The notes folder is relative to the selected vault/root, not the Health.md export subfolder. Turn on \"Inject metric sections\" to also write Sleep, Activity, etc. into the note body. Leave folder empty to search the vault root. Placeholders: {date}, {year}, {YR}, {month}, {day}, {weekday}, {monthName}, {quarter}." : {
      "comment" : "macOS production UI",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Fügt ausgewählte Messwerte in das YAML-Frontmatter Ihrer bestehenden täglichen Notizen ein. Der Notizen-Ordner ist relativ zum ausgewählten Tresor/Wurzelverzeichnis und nicht zum Health.md-Export-Unterordner. Aktivieren Sie \"Metrikabschnitte einfügen\", um zusätzlich Schlaf, Aktivität usw. in den Notiztext zu schreiben. Lassen Sie das Ordnerfeld leer, um im Wurzelverzeichnis des Tresors zu suchen. Platzhalter: {date}, {year}, {YR}, {month}, {day}, {weekday}, {monthName}, {quarter}."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Injects selected metrics into your existing daily notes' YAML frontmatter. The notes folder is relative to the selected vault/root, not the Health.md export subfolder. Turn on \"Inject metric sections\" to also write Sleep, Activity, etc. into the note body. Leave folder empty to search the vault root. Placeholders: {date}, {year}, {YR}, {month}, {day}, {weekday}, {monthName}, {quarter}."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Inyecta métricas seleccionadas en el front-matter YAML de sus notas diarias existentes. La carpeta de notas es relativa a la bóveda/raíz seleccionada, no a la subcarpeta de exportación Health.md. Active \"Inyectar secciones métricas\" para escribir también Dormir, Actividad, etc. en el cuerpo de la nota. Deje la carpeta vacía para buscar en la raíz del almacén. Marcadores de posición: {date}, {year}, {YR}, {month}, {day}, {weekday}, {monthName}, {quarter}."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Injecte les métriques sélectionnées dans le thème principal YAML de vos notes quotidiennes existantes. Le dossier de notes est relatif au coffre-fort/racine sélectionné, et non au sous-dossier d'exportation Health.md. Activez « Injecter des sections de métriques » pour écrire également le sommeil, l'activité, etc. dans le corps de la note. Laissez le dossier vide pour rechercher la racine du coffre-fort. Espaces réservés : {date}, {year}, {YR}, {month}, {day}, {weekday}, {monthName}, {quarter}."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Inserisce le metriche selezionate nel frontmatter YAML delle note giornaliere esistenti. La cartella delle note è relativa al vault/root selezionato, non alla sottocartella di esportazione Health.md. Attiva \"Inserisci sezioni metriche\" per scrivere anche sonno, attività, ecc. nel corpo della nota. Lascia la cartella vuota per cercare nella radice del vault. Segnaposto: {date}, {year}, {YR}, {month}, {day}, {weekday}, {monthName}, {quarter}."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "選択したメトリクスを既存のデイリーノートの YAML フロントマターに挿入します。メモ フォルダーは、Health.md エクスポート サブフォルダーではなく、選択したボールト/ルートに相対的です。 「指標セクションを挿入」をオンにすると、睡眠やアクティビティなどもノート本文に書き込まれます。ボルトのルートを検索するには、フォルダーを空のままにしておきます。プレースホルダー: {date}、{year}、{YR}、{month}、{day}、{weekday}、{monthName}、{quarter}。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "선택한 지표를 기존 일일 노트의 YAML 머리말에 삽입합니다. 메모 폴더는 Health.md 내보내기 하위 폴더가 아닌 선택한 볼트/루트에 상대적입니다. 수면, 활동 등을 노트 본문에 기록하려면 \"측정항목 섹션 삽입\"을 켜세요. 볼트 루트를 검색하려면 폴더를 비워 두세요. 자리 표시자: {date}, {year}, {YR}, {month}, {day}, {weekday}, {monthName}, {quarter}."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Injecteert geselecteerde statistieken in de YAML-voorgrond van uw bestaande dagelijkse notities. De notitiemap is relatief ten opzichte van de geselecteerde kluis/hoofdmap, niet de exportsubmap Health.md. Schakel 'Injecteer metrische secties' in om ook Slaap, Activiteit, etc. in de notitietekst te schrijven. Laat de map leeg om de kluismap te doorzoeken. Tijdelijke aanduidingen: {date}, {year}, {YR}, {month}, {day}, {weekday}, {monthName}, {quarter}."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Injeta métricas selecionadas no frontmatter YAML de suas notas diárias existentes. A pasta de notas é relativa ao vault/raiz selecionado, não à subpasta de exportação Health.md. Ative \"Injetar seções métricas\" para escrever também Sono, Atividade, etc. Deixe a pasta vazia para pesquisar na raiz do vault. Espaços reservados: {date}, {year}, {YR}, {month}, {day}, {weekday}, {monthName}, {quarter}."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "将选定的指标注入到现有每日笔记的 YAML frontmatter 中。注释文件夹是相对于选定的保管库/根目录的，而不是相对于 Health.md 导出子文件夹。打开“注入指标部分”也可以将睡眠、活动等写入笔记正文。将文件夹留空以搜索 Vault 根目录。占位符：{date}、{year}、{YR}、{month}、{day}、{weekday}、{monthName}、{quarter}。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Injects the same metrics enabled in Health Metrics. Manual exports, scheduled exports, and Mac destination exports run Daily Note Injection when it is enabled." : {
      "comment" : "macOS production UI",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Fügt dieselben Metriken ein, die in Health Metrics aktiviert sind. Manuelle Exporte, geplante Exporte und Mac-Zielexporte führen Daily Note Injection aus, wenn es aktiviert ist."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Injects the same metrics enabled in Health Metrics. Manual exports, scheduled exports, and Mac destination exports run Daily Note Injection when it is enabled."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Inyecta las mismas métricas habilitadas en Métricas de salud. Las exportaciones manuales, las exportaciones programadas y las exportaciones de destino Mac ejecutan la inyección diaria de notas cuando está habilitada."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Injecte les mêmes métriques activées dans Health Metrics. Les exportations manuelles, planifiées et les exportations de destination Mac exécutent l'injection de notes quotidiennes lorsqu'elle est activée."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Inserisce le stesse metriche abilitate in Metriche di integrità. Le esportazioni manuali, le esportazioni pianificate e le esportazioni di destinazione Mac eseguono l'inserimento di note giornaliere quando è abilitato."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ヘルスメトリクスで有効になっているのと同じメトリクスを挿入します。手動エクスポート、スケジュールされたエクスポート、および Mac 宛先エクスポートでは、Daily Note Injection が有効になっている場合に実行されます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "건강 항목에서 활성화된 것과 동일한 지표를 주입합니다. 수동 내보내기, 예약된 내보내기 및 Mac 대상 내보내기는 활성화된 경우 일일 노트 주입을 실행합니다."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Injecteert dezelfde statistieken die zijn ingeschakeld in Health Metrics. Bij handmatige exporten, geplande exporten en Mac-bestemmingsexports wordt Dagelijkse notitie-injectie uitgevoerd wanneer deze is ingeschakeld."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Injeta as mesmas métricas habilitadas em Health Metrics. Exportações manuais, exportações programadas e exportações de destino Mac executam a injeção de notas diárias quando estão habilitadas."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "注入在“健康指标”中启用的相同指标。启用“每日笔记注入”后，手动导出、计划导出和 Mac 目标位置导出都会执行该操作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
