    "Let Health.md on Mac receive iPhone-configured exports over your local network." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lassen Sie Health.md auf dem Mac über Ihr lokales Netzwerk Exporte empfangen, die auf dem iPhone konfiguriert wurden."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Permite que Health.md en el Mac reciba por la red local las exportaciones configuradas en el iPhone."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Autorisez Health.md sur Mac à recevoir, via votre réseau local, les exportations configurées sur l’iPhone."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Consenti a Health.md sul Mac di ricevere, tramite la rete locale, le esportazioni configurate sull’iPhone."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MacのHealth.mdが、iPhoneで設定したエクスポートをローカルネットワーク経由で受信できるようにします。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mac의 Health.md가 로컬 네트워크를 통해 iPhone에서 설정한 내보내기를 수신하도록 합니다."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Laat Health.md op de Mac via je lokale netwerk exports ontvangen die op de iPhone zijn geconfigureerd."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Permita que o Health.md no Mac receba, pela rede local, exportações configuradas no iPhone."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "允许 Mac 上的 Health.md 通过本地网络接收在 iPhone 上配置的导出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Let the healthmd command connect while this iPhone app is open, without running the Mac app." : {
