    "Opt in to summary files that aggregate your selected metrics across every export format without changing your daily notes." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aktiviere auf Wunsch Zusammenfassungsdateien, die deine ausgewählten Metriken über alle Exportformate hinweg zusammenfassen, ohne deine täglichen Notizen zu ändern."}},
        "es": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Activa si quieres los archivos de resumen que agrupan las métricas seleccionadas en todos los formatos de exportación sin modificar tus notas diarias."}},
        "fr": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Activez, si vous le souhaitez, des fichiers récapitulatifs regroupant les indicateurs sélectionnés dans chaque format d’exportation, sans modifier vos notes quotidiennes."}},
        "it": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Attiva facoltativamente i file di riepilogo che aggregano le metriche selezionate in tutti i formati di esportazione, senza modificare le note giornaliere."}},
        "ja": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"概要ファイルを有効にすると、デイリーノートを変更せずに、選択した指標をすべてのエクスポート形式で集計できます。"}},
        "ko": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"일일 노트를 변경하지 않고 모든 내보내기 형식에서 선택한 항목을 집계하는 요약 파일을 선택적으로 사용하세요."}},
        "nl": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Schakel desgewenst samenvattingsbestanden in die je geselecteerde meetwaarden samenvoegen in elk exportformaat, zonder je dagelijkse notities te wijzigen."}},
        "pt-BR": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ative, se desejar, arquivos de resumo que agregam suas métricas selecionadas em todos os formatos de exportação, sem alterar suas notas diárias."}},
        "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"可自行选择启用摘要文件，以所有导出格式汇总所选指标，而不更改你的每日笔记。"}}
      }
    },
    "Optimized for Obsidian Bases. All metrics are stored as frontmatter properties for querying, filtering, and sorting." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Optimiert für Obsidian Bases. Alle Metriken werden als Frontmatter-Eigenschaften gespeichert, um Abfragen, Filterungen und Sortierungen zu ermöglichen."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Optimized for Obsidian Bases. All metrics are stored as frontmatter properties for querying, filtering, and sorting."
