    "Scheduled exports pick up the new settings on their next run." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Geplante Exporte übernehmen die neuen Einstellungen beim nächsten Durchlauf."}},
        "es": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Las exportaciones programadas usarán los nuevos ajustes en su próxima ejecución."}},
        "fr": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Les exportations planifiées utiliseront les nouveaux paramètres à leur prochaine exécution."}},
        "it": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Le esportazioni pianificate useranno le nuove impostazioni alla prossima esecuzione."}},
        "ja": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"新しい設定は、次回の定期エクスポートから適用されます。"}},
        "ko": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"예약된 내보내기는 다음 실행부터 새 설정을 적용합니다."}},
        "nl": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Geplande exports gebruiken de nieuwe instellingen bij de volgende uitvoering."}},
        "pt-BR": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"As exportações agendadas usarão as novas configurações na próxima execução."}},
        "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"定时导出将在下次运行时使用新设置。"}}
      }
    },
    "Scheduled exports targeting an API endpoint with no configured URL now say exactly what to fix, and choosing the iCloud Drive root shows its real name." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Geplante Exporte an einen API-Endpunkt ohne konfigurierte URL zeigen jetzt genau, was zu korrigieren ist. Bei Auswahl des Stammordners von iCloud Drive wird dessen tatsächlicher Name angezeigt."}},
        "es": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Las exportaciones programadas destinadas a un endpoint de API sin URL configurada ahora indican exactamente qué corregir y, al elegir la raíz de iCloud Drive, se muestra su nombre real."}},
        "fr": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Les exportations planifiées vers un point de terminaison API sans URL configurée indiquent désormais précisément ce qu’il faut corriger, et la sélection de la racine iCloud Drive affiche son véritable nom."}},
        "it": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Le esportazioni pianificate verso un endpoint API senza URL configurato ora indicano esattamente cosa correggere; selezionando la cartella principale di iCloud Drive, viene mostrato il suo vero nome."}},
        "ja": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"URLが未設定のAPIエンドポイントへの定期エクスポートで、修正すべき内容が明確に表示されるようになりました。また、iCloud Driveのルートを選択すると、実際の名前が表示されます。"}},
        "ko": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"이제 URL이 설정되지 않은 API 엔드포인트로 예약 내보내기를 실행하면 수정할 사항을 정확히 안내하며, iCloud Drive 루트를 선택하면 실제 이름을 표시합니다."}},
        "nl": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Geplande exports naar een API-endpoint zonder ingestelde URL geven nu precies aan wat je moet aanpassen. Als je de hoofdmap van iCloud Drive kiest, wordt de echte naam weergegeven."}},
        "pt-BR": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"As exportações agendadas para um endpoint de API sem URL configurada agora indicam exatamente o que corrigir, e a seleção da raiz do iCloud Drive mostra seu nome real."}},
        "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"当定时导出的目标 API 端点未配置 URL 时，现在会明确提示需要修正的内容；选择 iCloud Drive 根目录时也会显示其真实名称。"}}
      }
    },
    "Scheduled exports write to %@ on this iPhone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Geplante Exporte werden auf diesem iPhone in %@ gespeichert."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Las exportaciones programadas se guardan en %@ en este iPhone."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les exportations programmées sont enregistrées dans %@ sur cet iPhone."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le esportazioni pianificate vengono salvate in %@ su questo iPhone."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "スケジュールエクスポートは、このiPhoneの%@に保存されます。"
          }
        },
