    "Send selected Apple Health exports directly to an HTTP or HTTPS endpoint you control, using your metric and granular-data settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sende ausgewählte Apple Health-Exporte direkt an einen von dir kontrollierten HTTP- oder HTTPS-Endpunkt, unter Verwendung deiner Einstellungen für Metriken und Detaildaten."}},
        "es": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Envía las exportaciones seleccionadas de Apple Health directamente a un endpoint HTTP o HTTPS que controles, con tus ajustes de métricas y datos detallados."}},
        "fr": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Envoyez les exportations Apple Health sélectionnées directement vers un point de terminaison HTTP ou HTTPS que vous contrôlez, selon vos paramètres d’indicateurs et de données détaillées."}},
        "it": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Invia le esportazioni Apple Health selezionate direttamente a un endpoint HTTP o HTTPS sotto il tuo controllo, usando le tue impostazioni per metriche e dati granulari."}},
        "ja": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"指標と詳細データの設定に従って、選択したApple Healthのエクスポートを、自分で管理するHTTPまたはHTTPSエンドポイントに直接送信します。"}},
        "ko": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"항목 및 세부 데이터 설정에 따라 선택한 Apple Health 내보내기를 직접 관리하는 HTTP 또는 HTTPS 엔드포인트로 바로 보내세요."}},
        "nl": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Stuur geselecteerde Apple Health-exports rechtstreeks naar een HTTP- of HTTPS-endpoint dat je beheert, met je instellingen voor meetwaarden en gedetailleerde gegevens."}},
        "pt-BR": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Envie as exportações selecionadas do Apple Health diretamente a um endpoint HTTP ou HTTPS que você controla, usando suas configurações de métricas e dados granulares."}},
