    "Show the onboarding flow again" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Einführung erneut anzeigen"}},
        "es": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Volver a mostrar el proceso de introducción"}},
        "fr": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Afficher à nouveau le parcours de découverte"}},
        "it": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mostra di nuovo la procedura di configurazione iniziale"}},
        "ja": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"初期案内をもう一度表示します"}},
        "ko": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"시작 안내를 다시 표시합니다"}},
        "nl": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"De introductie opnieuw tonen"}},
        "pt-BR": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mostrar a introdução novamente"}},
        "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"再次显示入门引导"}}
      }
    },
    "Show these two workout tables in Markdown exports and daily notes. Turn off to keep readable workout summaries without the tables. Structured data and source capture are unchanged." : {
      "comment" : "iPhone/iPad workout setting explanation and accessibility hint; presentation only",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Zeige diese beiden Trainingstabellen in Markdown-Exporten und täglichen Notizen. Schalte sie aus, um lesbare Trainingszusammenfassungen ohne die Tabellen zu behalten. Strukturierte Daten und Quelldatenerfassung bleiben unverändert." } },
        "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Show these two workout tables in Markdown exports and daily notes. Turn off to keep readable workout summaries without the tables. Structured data and source capture are unchanged." } },
        "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Muestra estas dos tablas de entrenamientos en las exportaciones Markdown y las notas diarias. Desactívalo para conservar resúmenes legibles de los entrenamientos sin las tablas. Los datos estructurados y la captura de datos de origen no cambian." } },
        "fr" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Affiche ces deux tableaux d’entraînement dans les exports Markdown et les notes quotidiennes. Désactivez cette option pour conserver des résumés d’entraînement lisibles sans les tableaux. Les données structurées et la capture des données sources restent inchangées." } },
        "it" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Mostra queste due tabelle degli allenamenti nelle esportazioni Markdown e nelle note giornaliere. Disattiva per mantenere riepiloghi leggibili degli allenamenti senza le tabelle. I dati strutturati e l’acquisizione dei dati di origine restano invariati." } },
        "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Markdownのエクスポートとデイリーノートに、この2つのワークアウトの表を表示します。オフにすると、表なしで読みやすいワークアウトの概要を残します。構造化データとソースデータの取得は変わりません。" } },
        "ko" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Markdown 내보내기와 일일 노트에 이 두 운동 표를 표시합니다. 끄면 표 없이 읽기 쉬운 운동 요약이 유지됩니다. 구조화된 데이터와 원본 데이터 수집은 변경되지 않습니다." } },
        "nl" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Toon deze twee trainingstabellen in Markdown-exports en dagelijkse notities. Schakel uit om leesbare trainingssamenvattingen zonder de tabellen te behouden. Gestructureerde gegevens en het vastleggen van brongegevens blijven ongewijzigd." } },
        "pt-BR" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Mostra estas duas tabelas de treinos nas exportações Markdown e nas notas diárias. Desative para manter resumos legíveis dos treinos sem as tabelas. Os dados estruturados e a captura de dados de origem permanecem inalterados." } },
        "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "在Markdown导出和每日笔记中显示这两个体能训练表格。关闭后可保留不含表格的易读体能训练摘要。结构化数据和源数据采集保持不变。" } }
      }
    },
    "Showing a lightweight preview of this %@ file. The full export will still include all data." : {
      "comment" : "macOS production UI",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zeigt eine kompakte Vorschau dieser %1$@-Datei. Der vollständige Export umfasst weiterhin alle Daten."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Showing a lightweight preview of this %1$@ file. The full export will still include all data."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mostrando una vista previa ligera de este archivo %1$@. La exportación completa seguirá incluyendo todos los datos."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Affichage d'un aperçu léger de ce fichier %1$@. L’exportation complète inclura toujours toutes les données."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mostra un'anteprima leggera di questo file %1$@. L'esportazione completa includerà comunque tutti i dati."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "この %1$@ ファイルの軽量プレビューを表示しています。完全なエクスポートにはすべてのデータが含まれます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "이 %1$@ 파일의 경량 미리보기를 표시합니다. 전체 내보내기에는 여전히 모든 데이터가 포함됩니다."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Er wordt een lichtgewicht voorbeeld van dit %1$@-bestand weergegeven. De volledige export bevat nog steeds alle gegevens."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mostrando uma visualização leve deste arquivo %1$@. A exportação completa ainda incluirá todos os dados."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "显示此 %1$@ 文件的轻量级预览。完整导出仍将包含所有数据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Showing every selected format from the most recent selected day. The full export will still include every selected date." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Es werden alle ausgewählten Formate des jüngsten ausgewählten Tages angezeigt. Der vollständige Export enthält weiterhin jedes ausgewählte Datum."
