    "The export format controls are easier to read, with Zip support presented alongside Markdown, Obsidian Bases, JSON, and CSV." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Die Bedienelemente für Exportformate sind übersichtlicher. Die ZIP-Unterstützung wird neben Markdown, Obsidian Bases, JSON und CSV angezeigt."}},
        "es": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Los controles de formato de exportación son más fáciles de leer y muestran la opción Zip junto a Markdown, Obsidian Bases, JSON y CSV."}},
        "fr": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Les commandes de format d’exportation sont plus lisibles, avec la prise en charge de Zip présentée aux côtés de Markdown, Obsidian Bases, JSON et CSV."}},
        "it": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"I controlli del formato di esportazione sono più leggibili e il supporto Zip è presentato insieme a Markdown, Obsidian Bases, JSON e CSV."}},
        "ja": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"エクスポート形式の設定が見やすくなり、Markdown、Obsidian Bases、JSON、CSVと並んでZipの設定も表示されるようになりました。"}},
        "ko": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"내보내기 형식 컨트롤을 더 읽기 쉽게 개선하고, Markdown, Obsidian Bases, JSON, CSV와 함께 Zip 지원을 표시합니다."}},
        "nl": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"De bediening voor exportindelingen is beter leesbaar, met Zip-ondersteuning naast Markdown, Obsidian Bases, JSON en CSV."}},
        "pt-BR": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Os controles de formato de exportação estão mais fáceis de ler, com suporte a Zip ao lado de Markdown, Obsidian Bases, JSON e CSV."}},
        "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"导出格式控件更清晰，Zip 支持与 Markdown、Obsidian Bases、JSON 和 CSV 一同显示。"}}
      }
    },
