            "value" : "Deze iPad is vindbaar door Health.md op Mac"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Este iPad pode ser descoberto pelo Health.md no Mac"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此 iPad 可被 Mac 上的 Health.md 发现"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is a read-only review. Loading and changing future profile selection perform no writes." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Diese Prüfung ist schreibgeschützt. Beim Laden und Ändern der künftigen Profilauswahl werden keine Daten geschrieben."}},
        "es": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Esta revisión es de solo lectura. Cargar y cambiar la selección futura de perfiles no escribe ningún dato."}},
        "fr": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cet aperçu est en lecture seule. Le chargement et la modification de la sélection du profil pour les prochaines utilisations n’effectuent aucune écriture."}},
        "it": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Questa è una revisione di sola lettura. Il caricamento e la modifica della selezione futura del profilo non eseguono scritture."}},
        "ja": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"これは読み取り専用の確認画面です。読み込みや今後使用するプロファイルの選択変更では、書き込みは行われません。"}},
        "ko": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"읽기 전용 검토입니다. 불러오기 및 향후 사용할 프로필 선택 변경은 데이터를 기록하지 않습니다."}},
        "nl": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dit is een alleen-lezen controle. Bij het laden en het wijzigen van de profielselectie voor later gebruik worden geen gegevens weggeschreven."}},
        "pt-BR": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Esta revisão é somente leitura. Carregar e alterar a seleção futura de perfis não grava dados."}},
        "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"此处仅供只读检查。加载及更改今后选用的配置均不会执行写入。"}}
      }
    },
    "This Keychain-encrypted store is independent from exported files. Retention is never automatic; deleting it does not change Apple Health on iPhone." : {
      "comment" : "macOS production UI",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dieser im Schlüsselbund verschlüsselte Speicher ist unabhängig von exportierten Dateien. Die Aufbewahrung erfolgt nie automatisch; das Löschen hat keine Auswirkungen auf Apple Health auf dem iPhone."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This Keychain-encrypted store is independent from exported files. Retention is never automatic; deleting it does not change Apple Health on iPhone."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Este almacén cifrado con Keychain es independiente de los archivos exportados. La retención nunca es automática; eliminarlo no cambia Apple Health en iPhone."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ce magasin crypté Keychain est indépendant des fichiers exportés. La rétention n’est jamais automatique ; sa suppression ne modifie pas Apple Health sur iPhone."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Questo archivio crittografato Keychain è indipendente dai file esportati. La conservazione non è mai automatica; eliminandolo non cambia Apple Health su iPhone."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "この Keychain 暗号化ストアは、エクスポートされたファイルから独立しています。保持は決して自動的には行われません。削除しても、iPhone の Apple Health は変更されません。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "이 Keychain 암호화 저장소는 내보낸 파일과 독립적입니다. 보존은 자동으로 이루어지지 않습니다. 이를 삭제해도 iPhone의 Apple Health는 변경되지 않습니다."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deze Keychain-gecodeerde winkel is onafhankelijk van geëxporteerde bestanden. Bewaring is nooit automatisch; het verwijderen ervan verandert niets aan Apple Health op iPhone."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Este armazenamento criptografado por Keychain é independente dos arquivos exportados. A retenção nunca é automática; excluí-lo não altera Apple Health em iPhone."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此 Keychain 加密存储独立于导出的文件。保留从来都不是自动的；删除它不会更改 iPhone 上的 Apple Health。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Mac app needs the iPhone app to read Apple Health and start exports. The Mac app only chooses where received files are saved." : {
      "comment" : "macOS production UI",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Diese Mac-App benötigt die iPhone-App, um Apple Health auszulesen und Exporte zu starten. Die Mac-App legt nur fest, wo empfangene Dateien gespeichert werden."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This Mac app needs the iPhone app to read Apple Health and start exports. The Mac app only chooses where received files are saved."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esta aplicación Mac necesita la aplicación iPhone para leer Apple Health e iniciar las exportaciones. La aplicación Mac solo elige dónde se guardan los archivos recibidos."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cette application Mac nécessite l'application iPhone pour lire Apple Health et démarrer les exportations. L'application Mac choisit uniquement où les fichiers reçus sont enregistrés."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Questa app Mac necessita dell'app iPhone per leggere Apple Health e avviare le esportazioni. L'app Mac sceglie solo dove salvare i file ricevuti."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "この Mac アプリには、Apple Health を読み取り、エクスポートを開始するために iPhone アプリが必要です。 Mac アプリは、受信したファイルの保存場所のみを選択します。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "이 Mac 앱은 Apple Health를 읽고 내보내기를 시작하려면 iPhone 앱이 필요합니다. Mac 앱은 수신된 파일이 저장되는 위치만 선택합니다."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deze Mac-app heeft de iPhone-app nodig om Apple Health te lezen en de export te starten. De Mac app kiest alleen waar ontvangen bestanden worden opgeslagen."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Este aplicativo Mac precisa do aplicativo iPhone para ler Apple Health e iniciar as exportações. O aplicativo Mac escolhe apenas onde os arquivos recebidos são salvos."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此 Mac 应用程序需要 iPhone 应用程序来读取 Apple Health 并开始导出。 Mac 应用程序仅选择接收到的文件的保存位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Mac saves the received Markdown, Bases, JSON, or CSV files" : {
