    "Updated app screens and widget previews match the new Health.md look across iPhone, iPad, Mac, and watchOS." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Überarbeitete App-Ansichten und Widget-Vorschauen entsprechen dem neuen Health.md-Design auf iPhone, iPad, Mac und watchOS."}},
        "es": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Las pantallas de la app y las vistas previas de los widgets se han actualizado para reflejar el nuevo aspecto de Health.md en iPhone, iPad, Mac y watchOS."}},
        "fr": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Les écrans de l’app et les aperçus des widgets mis à jour adoptent le nouveau style de Health.md sur iPhone, iPad, Mac et watchOS."}},
        "it": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Le schermate aggiornate dell’app e le anteprime dei widget rispecchiano il nuovo aspetto di Health.md su iPhone, iPad, Mac e watchOS."}},
        "ja": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"アプリ画面とウィジェットのプレビューを更新し、iPhone、iPad、Mac、watchOSで新しいHealth.mdのデザインに統一しました。"}},
        "ko": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"iPhone, iPad, Mac, watchOS의 앱 화면과 위젯 미리보기를 새로운 Health.md 디자인에 맞게 업데이트했습니다."}},
        "nl": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Vernieuwde appschermen en widgetvoorbeelden sluiten aan bij de nieuwe Health.md-vormgeving op iPhone, iPad, Mac en watchOS."}},
        "pt-BR": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"As telas atualizadas do app e as prévias dos widgets seguem o novo visual do Health.md no iPhone, iPad, Mac e watchOS."}},
        "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"更新后的应用页面和小组件预览与 iPhone、iPad、Mac 和 watchOS 上的 Health.md 全新外观保持一致。"}}
      }
    },
    "Updated privacy and analytics explanations spell out what limited product events contain—and what they never include." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aktualisierte Datenschutz- und Analysehinweise erklären genau, was begrenzte Produktereignisse enthalten – und was niemals erfasst wird."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Las explicaciones actualizadas de privacidad y analíticas detallan qué contienen los eventos limitados del producto y qué no incluyen nunca."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les explications mises à jour sur la confidentialité et l’analyse précisent ce que contiennent les événements produit limités et ce qu’ils n’incluent jamais."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le spiegazioni aggiornate su privacy e analisi indicano cosa contengono gli eventi limitati del prodotto e cosa non includono mai."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "更新されたプライバシーと分析の説明で、限定的な製品イベントに含まれる情報と、決して含まれない情報を明確にしました。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "업데이트된 개인정보 보호 및 분석 설명에서 제한적인 제품 이벤트에 포함되는 정보와 절대 포함되지 않는 정보를 명확히 안내합니다."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "De bijgewerkte uitleg over privacy en analyse maakt duidelijk wat beperkte productgebeurtenissen bevatten en welke gegevens daar nooit in staan."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "As explicações atualizadas de privacidade e análises detalham o que os eventos limitados do produto contêm e o que nunca incluem."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "更新后的隐私和分析说明明确解释了有限的产品事件会包含哪些内容，以及绝不会包含哪些信息。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Updates based on the selected export target and file naming settings" : {
