    "Use this ID to pin the profile in Shortcuts, the CLI (`healthmd export --profile`), and API automation." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Verwende diese ID, um das Profil in Kurzbefehlen, der CLI (`healthmd export --profile`) und der API-Automatisierung festzulegen."}},
        "es": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Usa este ID para fijar el perfil en Atajos, la CLI (`healthmd export --profile`) y las automatizaciones de la API."}},
        "fr": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Utilisez cet identifiant pour fixer le profil dans Raccourcis, la CLI (`healthmd export --profile`) et les automatisations via l’API."}},
        "it": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Usa questo ID per fissare il profilo in Comandi Rapidi, nella CLI (`healthmd export --profile`) e nelle automazioni API."}},
        "ja": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"このIDを使うと、ショートカット、CLI（`healthmd export --profile`）、API自動化でプロファイルを固定指定できます。"}},
        "ko": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"이 ID를 사용해 단축어, CLI(`healthmd export --profile`), API 자동화에서 프로필을 고정하세요."}},
        "nl": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Gebruik deze ID om het profiel vast te zetten in Opdrachten, de CLI (`healthmd export --profile`) en API-automatisering."}},
