        "it": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Eliminare il recupero in sospeso?"}},
        "ja": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"保留中の復旧を破棄しますか？"}},
        "ko": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"대기 중인 복구를 삭제할까요?"}},
        "nl": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Openstaand herstel wissen?"}},
        "pt-BR": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Descartar recuperação pendente?"}},
        "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"丢弃待恢复任务？"}}
      }
    },
    "Discard pending recovery for %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ausstehende Wiederherstellung für %@ verwerfen"}},
        "es": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Descartar la recuperación pendiente de %@"}},
        "fr": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Abandonner la récupération en attente pour %@"}},
        "it": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Elimina il recupero in sospeso per %@"}},
        "ja": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@の保留中の復旧を破棄"}},
        "ko": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@의 대기 중인 복구 삭제"}},
        "nl": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Openstaand herstel voor %@ wissen"}},
        "pt-BR": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Descartar recuperação pendente de %@"}},
        "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"丢弃%@的待恢复任务"}}
      }
    },
    "Discard unresolved scheduled exports for %@? Your profile, API credentials, export history, completed files and completed-run progress stay unchanged. No export starts now; an enabled schedule waits for its next ordinary occurrence." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Offene geplante Exporte für %@ verwerfen? Dein Profil, deine API-Zugangsdaten, dein Exportverlauf, fertige Dateien und der Fortschritt abgeschlossener Durchläufe bleiben unverändert. Es wird jetzt kein Export gestartet; ein aktivierter Zeitplan wartet auf den nächsten regulären Termin."}},
        "es": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"¿Descartar las exportaciones programadas sin resolver de %@? Tu perfil, las credenciales de la API, el historial de exportaciones, los archivos completados y el progreso de las ejecuciones completadas no cambiarán. No se iniciará ninguna exportación ahora; si la programación está activada, esperará hasta su próxima ejecución habitual."}},
        "fr": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Abandonner les exports programmés non résolus pour %@ ? Votre profil, vos identifiants API, votre historique d’export, les fichiers terminés et la progression des exécutions terminées restent inchangés. Aucun export ne démarre maintenant ; une programmation activée attend sa prochaine échéance normale."}},
        "it": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Eliminare le esportazioni programmate irrisolte per %@? Il profilo, le credenziali API, la cronologia delle esportazioni, i file completati e l’avanzamento delle esecuzioni completate restano invariati. Non verrà avviata alcuna esportazione ora; una programmazione attiva attenderà la prossima esecuzione ordinaria."}},
        "ja": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@の未解決のスケジュール済みエクスポートを破棄しますか？プロファイル、API認証情報、エクスポート履歴、完成したファイル、完了した実行の進捗は変わりません。今すぐエクスポートは開始されません。有効なスケジュールは次の通常の実行時刻まで待機します。"}},
        "ko": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@의 미해결 예약 내보내기를 삭제할까요? 프로필, API 인증 정보, 내보내기 기록, 완료된 파일 및 완료된 실행의 진행 상태는 변경되지 않습니다. 지금 내보내기가 시작되지는 않으며, 활성화된 일정은 다음 정규 실행 시간까지 대기합니다."}},
        "nl": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Onopgeloste geplande exports voor %@ wissen? Je profiel, API-inloggegevens, exportgeschiedenis, voltooide bestanden en de voortgang van voltooide uitvoeringen blijven ongewijzigd. Er start nu geen export; een ingeschakeld schema wacht tot het volgende reguliere moment."}},
        "pt-BR": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Descartar as exportações agendadas não resolvidas de %@? Seu perfil, credenciais de API, histórico de exportações, arquivos concluídos e progresso das execuções concluídas permanecem inalterados. Nenhuma exportação será iniciada agora; um agendamento ativado aguardará sua próxima ocorrência normal."}},
        "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"丢弃%@尚未解决的计划导出任务？您的配置、API 凭据、导出历史、已完成的文件及已完成运行的进度均保持不变。现在不会开始导出；已启用的计划将等待下一次正常执行时间。"}}
      }
    },
    "Disconnecting also revokes Health.md’s WHOOP access before credentials are removed from this iPhone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Beim Trennen wird auch der WHOOP-Zugriff von Health.md widerrufen, bevor die Zugangsdaten von diesem iPhone entfernt werden."}},
        "es": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Al desconectar, también se revoca el acceso de Health.md a WHOOP antes de eliminar las credenciales de este iPhone."}},
        "fr": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"La déconnexion révoque aussi l’accès de Health.md à WHOOP avant de supprimer les identifiants de cet iPhone."}},
        "it": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"La disconnessione revoca anche l’accesso di Health.md a WHOOP prima di rimuovere le credenziali da questo iPhone."}},
        "ja": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"接続を解除すると、このiPhoneから認証情報を削除する前に、Health.mdのWHOOPへのアクセス権も取り消されます。"}},
        "ko": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"연결을 해제하면 이 iPhone에서 인증 정보를 삭제하기 전에 Health.md의 WHOOP 접근 권한도 철회됩니다."}},
        "nl": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bij het verbreken van de verbinding wordt ook de WHOOP-toegang van Health.md ingetrokken voordat de inloggegevens van deze iPhone worden verwijderd."}},
        "pt-BR": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"A desconexão também revoga o acesso do Health.md ao WHOOP antes de remover as credenciais deste iPhone."}},
        "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"断开连接时，也会先撤销 Health.md 的 WHOOP 访问权限，再从此 iPhone 移除凭据。"}}
      }
    },
