    "Generated files and outcomes are easier to understand, with retries and informational notes easier to reach." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Erstellte Dateien und Ergebnisse sind leichter verständlich. Wiederholungsversuche und Hinweise sind einfacher zugänglich."}},
        "es": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Los archivos generados y los resultados son más fáciles de entender, y es más sencillo acceder a los reintentos y las notas informativas."}},
        "fr": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Les fichiers générés et les résultats sont plus faciles à comprendre, et les nouvelles tentatives et notes d’information sont plus accessibles."}},
        "it": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"I file generati e gli esiti sono più facili da comprendere; i nuovi tentativi e le note informative sono più accessibili."}},
        "ja": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"生成されたファイルと結果がわかりやすくなり、再試行や補足情報にもアクセスしやすくなりました。"}},
        "ko": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"생성된 파일과 결과를 더 쉽게 이해하고, 재시도와 안내 메모에 더 쉽게 접근할 수 있습니다."}},
        "nl": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aangemaakte bestanden en resultaten zijn duidelijker, en opties om opnieuw te proberen en informatieve opmerkingen zijn makkelijker te vinden."}},
        "pt-BR": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Os arquivos gerados e os resultados estão mais fáceis de entender, com acesso mais simples a novas tentativas e notas informativas."}},
        "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"生成的文件和结果更易理解，重试操作和说明信息也更容易找到。"}}
      }
    },
    "Gentle progress reminders" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dezente Fortschrittserinnerungen"}},
        "es": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Recordatorios discretos de progreso"}},
        "fr": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Rappels de progression discrets"}},
        "it": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Promemoria discreti sui progressi"}},
        "ja": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"進捗に応じた控えめなリマインダー"}},
        "ko": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"부담 없는 이용 현황 안내"}},
        "nl": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Subtiele voortgangsherinneringen"}},
        "pt-BR": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Lembretes discretos de progresso"}},
        "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"温和的进度提醒"}}
      }
    },
    "Get Mac Context Refresh Status" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Status der Mac-Kontextaktualisierung abrufen"}},
        "es": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Obtener el estado de actualización del contexto del Mac"}},
        "fr": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Obtenir l’état d’actualisation du contexte du Mac"}},
        "it": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ottieni stato aggiornamento contesto Mac"}},
        "ja": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Macコンテキスト更新状況を取得"}},
        "ko": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mac 컨텍스트 새로고침 상태 가져오기"}},
        "nl": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Status van Mac-contextvernieuwing ophalen"}},
        "pt-BR": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Obter status da atualização do contexto do Mac"}},
        "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"获取 Mac 上下文刷新状态"}}
      }
    },
    "Guidance after a successful export helps you export again or set up a schedule. The free plan includes five export actions." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hinweise nach einem erfolgreichen Export helfen dir, erneut zu exportieren oder einen Zeitplan einzurichten. Der kostenlose Tarif umfasst fünf Exportaktionen."}},
        "es": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Las indicaciones tras una exportación correcta te ayudan a volver a exportar o a configurar una programación. El plan gratuito incluye cinco acciones de exportación."}},
        "fr": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Après un export réussi, des conseils vous aident à exporter à nouveau ou à configurer une programmation. L’offre gratuite comprend cinq actions d’export."}},
        "it": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dopo un’esportazione riuscita, le indicazioni ti aiutano a esportare di nuovo o a impostare una programmazione. Il piano gratuito include cinque azioni di esportazione."}},
        "ja": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"エクスポート成功後のガイドで、再エクスポートやスケジュール設定をサポートします。無料プランには5回のエクスポートが含まれます。"}},
        "ko": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"내보내기에 성공하면 다시 내보내거나 일정을 설정할 수 있도록 안내합니다. 무료 요금제에는 내보내기 5회가 포함됩니다."}},
        "nl": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Na een geslaagde export helpen aanwijzingen je opnieuw te exporteren of een schema in te stellen. Het gratis abonnement bevat vijf exportacties."}},
        "pt-BR": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"As orientações após uma exportação bem-sucedida ajudam você a exportar novamente ou configurar um agendamento. O plano gratuito inclui cinco ações de exportação."}},
        "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"成功导出后的指引可帮助您再次导出或设置计划。免费方案包含五次导出操作。"}}
      }
    },
    "Health.md uploads each exported artifact file unchanged to this gateway's /v1/ingest endpoint using the Agent Data protocol. Gateways need no token in this version." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Health.md lädt jede exportierte Artefaktdatei unverändert über das Agent Data-Protokoll zum Endpunkt /v1/ingest dieses Gateways hoch. Gateways benötigen in dieser Version kein Token."}},
        "es": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Health.md sube cada archivo de artefacto exportado sin modificar al punto de conexión /v1/ingest de esta pasarela mediante el protocolo Agent Data. Las pasarelas no necesitan ningún token en esta versión."}},
        "fr": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Health.md envoie chaque fichier d’artefact exporté sans modification au point de terminaison /v1/ingest de cette passerelle via le protocole Agent Data. Les passerelles ne nécessitent aucun jeton dans cette version."}},
        "it": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Health.md carica ogni file prodotto dall’esportazione senza modificarlo sull’endpoint /v1/ingest di questo gateway tramite il protocollo Agent Data. In questa versione i gateway non richiedono token."}},
        "ja": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Health.mdは、Agent Dataプロトコルを使用し、エクスポートされた各成果物ファイルを変更せずにこのゲートウェイの/v1/ingestエンドポイントにアップロードします。このバージョンでは、ゲートウェイにトークンは不要です。"}},
        "ko": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Health.md는 Agent Data 프로토콜을 사용하여 내보낸 각 아티팩트 파일을 변경 없이 이 게이트웨이의 /v1/ingest 엔드포인트로 업로드합니다. 이 버전에서는 게이트웨이에 토큰이 필요하지 않습니다."}},
        "nl": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Health.md uploadt elk geëxporteerd artefactbestand ongewijzigd naar het /v1/ingest-eindpunt van deze gateway via het Agent Data-protocol. Gateways hebben in deze versie geen token nodig."}},
        "pt-BR": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"O Health.md envia cada arquivo de artefato exportado sem alterações ao endpoint /v1/ingest deste gateway usando o protocolo Agent Data. Os gateways não exigem token nesta versão."}},
        "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Health.md 使用 Agent Data 协议，将每个导出产物文件原样上传到此网关的 /v1/ingest 端点。此版本中的网关无需令牌。"}}
      }
    },
    "Health.md uploads each exported artifact file unchanged to your gateway's /v1/ingest endpoint using the Agent Data protocol. Re-uploading identical artifacts is idempotent. Gateways use HTTP or HTTPS and need no token in this version." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Health.md lädt jede exportierte Artefaktdatei unverändert über das Agent Data-Protokoll zum Endpunkt /v1/ingest deines Gateways hoch. Erneutes Hochladen identischer Artefakte ist idempotent. Gateways verwenden HTTP oder HTTPS und benötigen in dieser Version kein Token."}},
        "es": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Health.md sube cada archivo de artefacto exportado sin modificar al punto de conexión /v1/ingest de tu pasarela mediante el protocolo Agent Data. Volver a subir artefactos idénticos es idempotente. Las pasarelas usan HTTP o HTTPS y no necesitan ningún token en esta versión."}},
        "fr": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Health.md envoie chaque fichier d’artefact exporté sans modification au point de terminaison /v1/ingest de votre passerelle via le protocole Agent Data. Le renvoi d’artefacts identiques est idempotent. Les passerelles utilisent HTTP ou HTTPS et ne nécessitent aucun jeton dans cette version."}},
        "it": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Health.md carica ogni file prodotto dall’esportazione senza modificarlo sull’endpoint /v1/ingest del tuo gateway tramite il protocollo Agent Data. Il caricamento ripetuto di artefatti identici è idempotente. I gateway usano HTTP o HTTPS e in questa versione non richiedono token."}},
        "ja": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Health.mdは、Agent Dataプロトコルを使用し、エクスポートされた各成果物ファイルを変更せずにゲートウェイの/v1/ingestエンドポイントにアップロードします。同一の成果物を再アップロードしても結果は変わりません。ゲートウェイはHTTPまたはHTTPSを使用し、このバージョンではトークンは不要です。"}},
        "ko": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Health.md는 Agent Data 프로토콜을 사용하여 내보낸 각 아티팩트 파일을 변경 없이 게이트웨이의 /v1/ingest 엔드포인트로 업로드합니다. 동일한 아티팩트를 다시 업로드해도 결과는 같습니다. 게이트웨이는 HTTP 또는 HTTPS를 사용하며, 이 버전에서는 토큰이 필요하지 않습니다."}},
        "nl": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Health.md uploadt elk geëxporteerd artefactbestand ongewijzigd naar het /v1/ingest-eindpunt van je gateway via het Agent Data-protocol. Identieke artefacten opnieuw uploaden is idempotent. Gateways gebruiken HTTP of HTTPS en hebben in deze versie geen token nodig."}},
        "pt-BR": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"O Health.md envia cada arquivo de artefato exportado sem alterações ao endpoint /v1/ingest do seu gateway usando o protocolo Agent Data. O reenvio de artefatos idênticos é idempotente. Os gateways usam HTTP ou HTTPS e não exigem token nesta versão."}},
        "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Health.md 使用 Agent Data 协议，将每个导出产物文件原样上传到您网关的 /v1/ingest 端点。重复上传相同产物具有幂等性。网关使用 HTTP 或 HTTPS，此版本中无需令牌。"}}
      }
    },
    "Help us grow" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hilf uns zu wachsen"}},
        "es": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ayúdanos a crecer"}},
        "fr": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aidez-nous à grandir"}},
        "it": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aiutaci a crescere"}},
        "ja": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"成長にご協力ください"}},
        "ko": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"성장을 도와주세요"}},
        "nl": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Help ons groeien"}},
        "pt-BR": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ajude-nos a crescer"}},
        "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"帮助我们成长"}}
      }
    },
    "Help with WHOOP" : {
